      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Providence%2C_Rhode_Island"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town contains Canada Pond, Wenscott Reservoir, and the Woonasquatucket River, all popular spots for fishing and kayaking.",
